          "zh-CN": "**联合求值。** 若 f(x)∈U 且 U 开，局部紧 Hausdorff 性给出开集 V 与紧集 L，使 x∈V⊆L⊆f⁻¹(U)。于是 [L,U]×V 映入 U。",
          "en": "For joint evaluation, choose x in an open V contained in a compact L contained in f^{-1}(U); then [L,U] times V maps into U."
        }
      }
